Agent opens a Policy record in D365 and clicks Non-Header.
Form validates policy fields and opens kofc_policy_details.html in a new tab.
HTML page reads the policy record from Dataverse.
Page gets an MSAL user token (silent, or redirect on first sign-in).
Page calls Boomi with Bearer token + x-api-key + userId + policyRecordId + policy params.
Boomi validates the user token, then calls the Azure Function with its own Policy.Read token.
Function checks Dataverse access and returns Non-Header / Tier One JSON.
HTML page renders the report (print supported).
